    {
      "file": "science-careers-that-involve-travel-summary.webp",
      "mobile": "science-careers-that-involve-travel-summary-mobile.webp",
      "alt": "A short visual summary of Science Careers That Involve Travel.",
      "caption": "Key points at a glance.",
      "heading": "Key Ideas at a Glance",
      "content": {
        "kind": "bundle",
        "sourceNeedCount": 4,
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "summary",
            "heading": "Key ideas from this article",
            "kind": "items",
            "items": [
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "Before comparing tracks, set expectations correctly."
              },
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "If a page promises one, it is selling a fantasy, not a career map."
              },
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "Field work can be remote and physically hard."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "needId": "detail:3",
            "type": "detail",
            "heading": "Polar Expeditions and Test-Range Science",
            "kind": "items",
            "items": [
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "These come up constantly in \"travel science career\" searches, and they deserve an honest, direct answer rather than being quietly left out."
              },
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "India's Antarctic and Arctic research programme, run through the National Centre for Polar and Ocean Research (NCPOR), sends a genuinely small number of scientists a year, almost always PhD-level specialists in glaciology, atmospheric science, or polar oceanography, to stations like Maitri and Bharati."
              },
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "Test-range science, flight-test and trial-campaign work at DRDO, ISRO, or HAL, involves real travel to test sites like Chandipur, Sriharikota, or Thumba during trial campaigns."
              }
            ],
            "sourceSectionId": "niche-tracks",
            "sourceNeedIndex": 3
          },
          {
            "needId": "detail:5",
            "type": "detail",
            "heading": "Competition Gets Serious",
            "kind": "items",
            "items": [
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "Several of these tracks have more than one hard filter, not just one entrance exam."
              },
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "Entry into GSI and ONGC as a geologist runs through a competitive recruitment or GATE-linked exam and interview."
              },
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "Clearing the Wildlife Institute of India's entrance test for its postgraduate programme is genuinely competitive on its own."
              }
            ],
            "sourceSectionId": "competition",
            "sourceNeedIndex": 5
          },
          {
            "needId": "detail:6",
            "type": "detail",
            "heading": "Four Questions Before You Chase This",
            "kind": "items",
            "items": [
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "A pay table cannot tell you whether fieldwork-heavy science genuinely fits your temperament, your finances, and your life stage."
              },
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "These careers reward people who can genuinely tolerate weeks away from home comforts, rough accommodation, physical exertion, and unpredictable schedules, and who do not treat fieldwork as a temporary adventure phase before \"settling down\" into a desk."
              },
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "If the pull is really the idea of travel photos, not the actual science being done at the site, that mismatch shows up fast in the first field season, not years later."
              }
            ],
            "sourceSectionId": "checkpoint",
            "sourceNeedIndex": 6
          },
          {
            "needId": "detail:8",
            "type": "detail",
            "heading": "Waste Years Chasing the Wrong Track",
            "kind": "items",
            "items": [
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "It is not one profession."
              },
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "It is usually the lowest-paying and least stable of the six, mostly project-funded rather than permanent."
              },
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "Entry-level science writing and reporting roles are mostly desk-based."
              }
            ],
            "sourceSectionId": "mistakes",
            "sourceNeedIndex": 8
          }
        ]
      },
      "type": "summary",
      "title": "Key Ideas At a Glance"
    },
